о si.","wordIds":["lesson-183-a1-word-2","lesson-183-a1-word-7"],"order":4,"difficulty":"easy","button":"Далі","fullSentence":"Ty si Peter."},{"id":"lesson-183-a1-ex-5","lessonId":"lesson-183-a1","type":"fill_blank","question":"«_____ je Marek.»","options":["On","Ona","Ty","Ja"],"correctAnswer":"On","explanation":"Для чоловіка вживаємо on.","wordIds":["lesson-183-a1-word-3","lesson-183-a1-word-8"],"order":5,"difficulty":"easy","button":"Далі","fullSentence":"On je Marek."},{"id":"lesson-183-a1-ex-6","lessonId":"lesson-183-a1","type":"multiple_choice_translation","question":"Про дівчину Eva говоримо:","options":["Ona je Eva.","On je Eva.","Ono je Eva.","Ty je Eva."],"correctAnswer":"Ona je Eva.","explanation":"Для дівчини використовуємо ona.","wordIds":["lesson-183-a1-word-4","lesson-183-a1-word-8"],"order":6,"difficulty":"easy","button":"Далі"},{"id":"lesson-183-a1-ex-7","lessonId":"lesson-183-a1","type":"multiple_choice_translation","question":"Яка модель правильна для dieťa?","options":["Ono je dieťa.","Ona je dieťa.","On je dieťa.","Ty je dieťa."],"correctAnswer":"Ono je dieťa.","explanation":"У цьому прикладі dieťa — середній рід, тому ono.","wordIds":["lesson-183-a1-word-5","lesson-183-a1-word-16"],"order":7,"difficulty":"medium","button":"Далі"},{"id":"lesson-183-a1-ex-8","lessonId":"lesson-183-a1","type":"reverse_translation","question":"Як словацькою буде «він»?","options":["on","ona","ono","ty"],"correctAnswer":"on","explanation":"on = він.","wordIds":["lesson-183-a1-word-3"],"order":8,"difficulty":"medium","button":"Далі"},{"id":"lesson-183-a1-ex-9","lessonId":"lesson-183-a1","type":"multiple_choice_translation","question":"Анна говорить про себе: «_____ som Anna.»","options":["Ja","Ty","Ona","On"],"correctAnswer":"Ja","explanation":"Мовець про себе → ja.","wordIds":["lesson-183-a1-word-1"],"order":9,"difficulty":"medium","button":"Далі"},{"id":"lesson-183-a1-ex-10","lessonId":"lesson-183-a1","type":"fill_blank","question":"Обери форму byť: «Ona _____ Eva.